sdiv12: x / 12, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-27, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-27 to where the program needs x / 12, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 12 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 18 cells. It runs 18 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

